  "description": "appsettings.json configuration for .NET MAUI apps, from the app package as a MauiAsset or from an assembly's embedded resources, with the usual appsettings.{environment}.json overlay.\nMAUI references Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration but not the JSON provider, so builder.Configuration has no AddJsonStream. That is what this supplies.",
  "iconFile": "me.png",
  "id": "Me.Toolkit.Maui.Configuration",
